    { text: "Month 4", title: "Rapid Planning Method", description: "Tony’s Rapid Planning Method (RPM) alters your entire approach to how you feel about managing time. In month four, you’ll learn the power of the RPM." },
    { text: "Month 5", title: "Communicate company values", description: "Developing and communicating core company values is key to recruiting and retaining loyal employees. Identify your value chain process to eliminate personnel chokeholds in month five." },
    { text: "Month 6", title: "Empower your team", description: "Conflict resolution, communication skills and empowering your team are all included in Tony’s 7 master steps to effective leadership." }
